            "title": "EXCLUSIVE: Eco Wave Power Marks US Manufacturing Debut With Port Of Los Angeles Project",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Eco Wave Power Global (NASDAQ:WAVE) today announced the signing of a manufacturing deal with All-Ways Metal, Inc., a woman-owned business based in California, to produce floaters for its innovative wave energy project in the Port of Los Angeles. The financial terms of the deal remain undisclosed. The floaters, which form a key component of Eco Wave Power's proprietary wave energy conversion technology, will be manufactured locally by All-Ways Metal and are scheduled for delivery within 70 days.",
